Description: ROS 2 pub/sub counts and rates from ros2_tracing (LTTng)
 Per-node, per-topic publish/receive counts and rates from the ros2:*
 tracepoints built into Jazzy's rcl/rmw. Monitored nodes need no changes.
 .
 Installed in /opt/ros/jazzy as the ament package ros2_topic_tracing:
 trace_ctl (start/stop tracing, choose traced processes), topic_stats (CLI),
 topic_diagnostics (node publishing /diagnostics, YAML config) with
 topic_diagnostics.launch.py, and trace_daemon (C++, babeltrace2).
